     * profiles sit behind a Cloudflare challenge, so a call can take up to about a minute.
     * `mode=search` lists Wellfound's startup directory by `location` or `industry` (10 companies
     * per page, paged up to `max_results`) with website, description, markets, locations and open-
     * job counts. Billed one unit per page fetched (`pagesFetched`).
