     * intelligence', 'health-care', 'e-commerce'; see wellfound.com/browse/tech-industries).
     * Common names such as 'fintech', 'healthcare', 'crypto' or 'edtech' are mapped to their slug.
     *   - url: mode=search: a Wellfound directory URL
     * (https://wellfound.com/startups/location/new-york or /startups/industry/<industry>) instead
     * of location / industry.
